---
// Keyboard users land here first; it stays visually hidden until focused.
---

<a
	href="#main-content"
	class="skip-link btn btn-signal absolute top-4 left-4 z-[9999] no-print"
>
	Saltar al contenido principal
</a>

<style>
	.skip-link {
		position: absolute;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		padding: 0;
		margin: -1px;
		overflow: hidden;
		clip-path: inset(50%);
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.skip-link:focus-visible {
		position: absolute;
		width: auto;
		height: auto;
		padding: 0.9375rem 1.75rem;
		margin: 0;
		overflow: visible;
		clip-path: none;
	}
</style>
